    "decision_16k_vs_4k_citation": "iPhone 7 SoC is T8010 (A10 Fusion). postmarketOS wiki 'Apple Generic iDevice (apple-idevice)' https://wiki.nura.eco/wiki/Apple_Generic_iDevice_(apple-idevice) (retrieved 2026-09-29): 4K kernel for A7/A8/A8X; 16K kernel for A9/A9X/A10 Fusion/A10X/A11/T2. Corroborated by pmaports @ 34a4e3c3a38c88f52319ecce80f02b561d2eeee2 config-postmarketos-apple-16k.aarch64 line 462 CONFIG_ARM64_16K_PAGES=y (4k flavor sets ARM64_4K_PAGES instead, line 461) and device-apple-idevice/APKBUILD kernel_4k/kernel_16k subpackages. Summarized in docs/bars.md (bar 3). The in-tree reason for the A9+ 16K requirement is not documented in the kernel source; the rule is established at the distribution level."
  },
